OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny spells with the
OL,6,Fbest of the sunshine around the west
OL,7,Fcoast and over Skye and Eilean Siar.
OL,8,FMainly dry but a few showers towards
OL,9,FSkye and Eilean Siar first thing, and
OL,10,Fthe odd afternoon shower developing.
OL,11,FWarm.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny showers soon fading out
OL,14,Fto leave a dry evening with some
OL,15,Fbright spells. Clouding over from the
OL,16,Feast overnight, with some outbreaks of
OL,17,Frain developing in the early hours.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
