OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F175A1787804254
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FRain in the east, perhaps
OL,6,Fturning heavy at times before
OL,7,Fgradually easing through the afternoon
OL,8,Fand evening. Generally drier but quite
OL,9,Fcloudy in the west. Occasionally
OL,10,Fbreezy around the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,13,Fand fresh winds clearing early
OL,14,FSaturday. Then rain or showers at
OL,15,Ftimes, occasionally heavy, along with
OL,16,Fsome drier and brighter spells. Winds
OL,17,Fwill be mostly light, freshening on
OL,18,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
